{"actor":"hypothesis","data":{"concepts":["feature scaling","standardisation","k-nearest-neighbour","accuracy"],"description":"The evidence only tests the impact of standardisation (specifically Min-Max Scaling) on KNN classification in two specific datasets: the Pima Indians Diabetes Dataset and a context involving diabetic retinopathy screening with tabular data. There is no evidence on whether other scaling methods (e.g., Z-score standardisation, robust scaling) perform comparably or better, leaving a gap in understanding the relative effectiveness of different standardisation techniques.","evidence_ids":["E1","E2"],"id":"G1","kind":"uncovered"},"hash":"eb54b3d93cedec9498d1408ba966a548a508c2d233b177cbfa81762565724f0a","kind":"artefact","prev":"d03dc1975aad59f52174d2bfa4f2fc6b9bc3bd0e9149e3c162085f92809f1dbb","seq":16,"stage":"gaps","ts":"2026-10-10T03:22:53.641+00:00"}
{"actor":"hypothesis","data":{"concepts":["feature scaling","], "],"description":"The claims are based solely on accuracy and ROC AUC metrics, with no information provided on other performance aspects such as precision, recall, or computational efficiency. This limits the understanding of how standardisation affects model performance beyond these two metrics.","evidence_ids":["E1","E2"],"id":"G2","kind":"uncovered"},"hash":"5d28d3abc40fb1a58c4d7269dd907b6f939e18e501c0ee4f4ed48f5862e6d2fd","kind":"artefact","prev":"eb54b3d93cedec9498d1408ba966a548a508c2d233b177cbfa81762565724f0a","seq":17,"stage":"gaps","ts":"2026-10-10T03:22:53.641+00:00"}
{"actor":"hypothesis","data":{"concepts":["tabular data","feature scaling","k-nearest-neighbour"],"description":"The evidence is limited to tabular data in specific medical domains (diabetes-related datasets), and does not generalise to other types of tabular data (e.g., financial, customer behaviour) or different data distributions (e.g., highly skewed, outliers), raising questions about the generalisability of the findings.","evidence_ids":["E1","E2"],"id":"G3","kind":"narrow_scope"},"hash":"bbe9aeb9c009c9a0f233ed4d096033aaa37c0cefa342f887de4f9101ae054223","kind":"artefact","prev":"5d28d3abc40fb1a58c4d7269dd907b6f939e18e501c0ee4f4ed48f5862e6d2fd","seq":18,"stage":"gaps","ts":"2026-10-10T03:22:53.642+00:00"}
